  "data": {
    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Cybernetica Datasmith",
    "summary": "If this model leads a KASTELAN ROBOTS unit as the battle starts, that unit enters the Aegis Protocol. During your Command phase you may, while this model leads a KASTELAN ROBOTS unit, move that unit into any one of the protocols below; a unit stays in a protocol until it enters another. Protector Protocol: KASTELAN ROBOT models in the unit get +2 Attacks on their ranged weapons. Conqueror Protocol: they get +2 Attacks on their melee weapons. Aegis Protocol: they get +1 Toughness.",
